  "description": "The Tone Bender MkII with the Mode switch of Aion FX's Deimos: MkII, or Q1 bypassed for the earlier two-transistor Tone Bender \"1.5\" (much like a Fuzz Face). Three germanium PNPs, positive ground (the supply is -9 V); the OC75s (some units OC81D) are our own fit to Mullard's OC75 sheet (D-184), given measured hFE and leakage from the middle of Aion's ranges. TR1 is set for Aion's Q2 collector reading (-0.16 V; its bias target).",
